-- (verified against the live endpoint). The default below is still sent when the user
-- leaves the effort field empty.
-- Reasoning is allowed to run long: requests go out over HttpService:RequestAsync when the
-- executor's 30s cap trips, and the engine client has no such limit, so the model can think
-- for as long as it needs. Raise it in Setup if you want it to think harder or longer.
AI.orEffortDefault = "medium"
